url: "https://github.com/huanghy95/OpsLens"
abstract: >-
  OpsLens is a runbook-free root cause analysis framework for AIOps. It uses
  LLM-based multi-agent collaboration to analyze logs, metrics, and traces,
  with two-stage tool generation and quality-focused tool management.
